      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1765709009,
      "version": 836,
      "versionNonce": 2124620880,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792248853246,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1.  Scan infix from left to right .\n\n2. check wheather character is operator or operand .\n\n3.  If it is operand concate it in postfix and goto step 5.\n\n4.  If it is an operator \n  \n a. check wheather it is empty or not .\n \n b. If it is empty push operator in stack and go to step 5.\n\n c. If it is not empty compare the operator precedence with\nstacktop operator . \n\n d. If the precedence of outside operator is high push it into\nstack and go to step 5.\n\n e. If precedence of stacktop is high or equal pop it and\nconcate it in postfix and go to 4a. \n\n5. Repeat the steps untill infix expression ends .\n\n6. pop all the remaining operators from stack and concate it in\npostfix .",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1.  Scan infix from left to right .\n\n2. check wheather character is operator or operand .\n\n3.  If it is operand concate it in postfix and goto step 5.\n\n4.  If it is an operator \n  \n a. check wheather it is empty or not .\n \n b. If it is empty push operator in stack and go to step 5.\n\n c. If it is not empty compare the operator precedence with stacktop operator . \n\n d. If the precedence of outside operator is high push it into stack and go to step 5.\n\n e. If precedence of stacktop is high or equal pop it and concate it in postfix and go to 4a. \n\n5. Repeat the steps untill infix expression ends .\n\n6. pop all the remaining operators from stack and concate it in postfix .",
